WEBVTT

00:00:00.111 --> 00:00:04.671
This video shows how to read a message and reply to it on a phone.

00:00:06.372 --> 00:00:17.076
Tap the menu button and choose Messages. A conversation with unread messages shows a number. Tap the conversation to open it and read the message.

00:00:30.637 --> 00:00:34.045
Tap the box at the bottom and type your reply.

00:00:46.682 --> 00:00:53.066
Tap the arrow button to send. Your reply appears on the right side of the conversation.

00:01:03.991 --> 00:01:07.423
Your reply is sent in the same conversation.
